{title: Every Time I Feel the Spirit}
{artist: Traditional spiritual}
{genre: Gospel}
{style: Spiritual}
{flow: Opening}
{key: G}
{tempo: 92}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_chorus}
[G]Every time I feel the Spirit moving in my [C]heart I will [G]pray
Yes, every time I feel the Spirit moving in my [D]heart I will [G]pray
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Upon the mountain my Lord spoke
Out of His [C]mouth came fire and [G]smoke
Looked all around me, it looked so [C]fine
Till I [D]asked my Lord if all was [G]mine
{end_of_verse}

